flowchart LR
    U([User query /\npreferences]) --> Agent

    subgraph Core["Core AI System"]
        Agent[Agent / Orchestrator\nRAGEngine + Recommender]
        Retriever[Retriever\nKnowledgeBase]
        LLM[LLM Client]

        Agent -->|query| Retriever
        Retriever -->|retrieved docs| Agent
        Agent -->|prompt + context| LLM
        LLM -->|generated text| Agent
    end

    Agent --> Output([Output:\nrecommendation +\nexplanation])
    Output --> User2([User])

    subgraph QA["Testing & Evaluation (offline / CI)"]
        Tester[Unit Tests\ntests/*.py]
        Evaluator[ReliabilityHarness\nConsistencyChecker +\nGroundednessChecker]
        Report[[EvalReport /\nreliability_report.md]]
    end

    Agent -.eval cases.-> Evaluator
    Retriever -.eval cases.-> Evaluator
    Tester -.regression checks.-> Agent
    Evaluator --> Report

    Human{{Human Reviewer}}
    Report --> Human
    Human -->|approve| Deploy([Ship / keep config])
    Human -->|flag issues| Fix([Fix prompt / data /\ncode])
    Fix --> Agent

    style Human fill:#f9d77e,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style QA fill:#eef,stroke:#556
    style Core fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#565
